 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ig_mdzmKkCwQ7kNvwFmIZ5C&_nc_oc=Adri6fPJD991nvisenlScEGZd8V4_ssthY5pQeezJjyOYVqd3HwZnONTZR3-gdGdLZ4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIYrxf7jFG2VIaC1f2CdRSKD3k2NT-qwkmAfIcbjeKr2w&oe=6AA6BEC1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=G7VLCJz5OQQQ7kNvwG0kBoi&_nc_oc=AdojXYhS5BNIF1eKARW5QwGp8gbmsHmMYiqs2r2A5BlBm3ovTfw6jne0G58xVjFxjDA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJAQzx2yHzEh1TC-zL6TPUHFnYzwHSlPMwMVdRX5XkdcQ&oe=6AA693E6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pOSKZU3YaL8Q7kNvwE4kMAw&_nc_oc=AdoyIN-cQSUpBfAhZ6MZ_CxUfQflqEvLulJBeFQ3-y9_nB6hUDEY200XM83B-D6UKZU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLN4DVocUaNnMDUQUneqhgoZab98qknfSXb1RKLMEKlBg&oe=6AA69DDC"}, {"fil